      "analysis_html": "<div class=\"math-tex math-block\" data-display=\"true\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\text{由题设可知} \\lambda \\text{的概率密度为} \\; &amp; f(x) = \\begin{cases} e^{-x}, \\; x &gt; 0 \\\\ 0, \\; \\; x \\leq 0 \\end{cases}, \\\\E(X + e^{-2Y}) &amp;= E(X) + E(e^{-2Y}) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x f(x) dx + \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{-2x} f(x) dx \\\\&amp;= \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x e^{-y} dx + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} e^{-2y} f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x e^{-y} dx + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} e^{-3y} dx \\\\&amp;= 1 + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}\">\\begin{aligned}\\text{由题设可知} \\lambda \\text{的概率密度为} \\; &amp; f(x) = \\begin{cases} e^{-x}, \\; x &gt; 0 \\\\ 0, \\; \\; x \\leq 0 \\end{cases}, \\\\E(X + e^{-2Y}) &amp;= E(X) + E(e^{-2Y}) = \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} x f(x) dx + \\int_{-\\infty}^{+\\infty} e^{-2x} f(x) dx \\\\&amp;= \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x e^{-y} dx + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} e^{-2y} f(x) dx = \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} x e^{-y} dx + \\int_{0}^{+\\infty} e^{-3y} dx \\\\&amp;= 1 + \\frac{1}{3} = \\frac{4}{3}.\\end{aligned}</div>"
